WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.080
Hi, I'm Tilly! Pictures now show up even without graphics.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.060
This terminal has no sixel and no kitty graphics.

00:00:08.345 --> 00:00:10.845
So the picture is drawn with octants instead.

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:13.366
Quadrants work in every font.

00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:18.047
And half blocks suit the Linux console.

00:00:21.908 --> 00:00:24.548
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
